# Excerpt: lines selected verbatim from the raw files named below; hostnames, IPs, user names and GPU UUIDs
# replaced with <placeholders>. Nothing else edited. Times are Pacific (PT) unless the line says otherwise; vLLM server
# log lines are UTC ("10-09 03:05:11" = 2026-10-08 20:05:11 PDT).
